281
00:15:59,020 --> 00:16:01,980
It's better than <i>this</i> .

282
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:05,190
Even if there's nobody on the inside?

283
00:16:06,230 --> 00:16:10,310
If all the people on the inside
with you came outside,

284
00:16:10,310 --> 00:16:12,690
then you'd be all alone in there.

285
00:16:12,690 --> 00:16:14,480
Yeah...

286
00:16:15,690 --> 00:16:20,440
You don't care if you're inside or outside.

287
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:23,650
