355
00:18:54,650 --> 00:18:56,770
Sorry, my phone's busted.

356
00:18:56,770 --> 00:18:59,980
I'm gonna go get it fixed tomorrow.

357
00:18:59,980 --> 00:19:03,600
Oh. Okay.

358
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:07,600
I totally thought he was ignoring me...

359
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:12,520
