360
00:19:12,520 --> 00:19:15,310
It was me.

361
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:16,900
Did it stress you out?

362
00:19:16,900 --> 00:19:18,480
Huh?

363
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:22,270
No, never mind! I'm heading out.

364
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:24,060
Tanihara- <i>kun</i> ?

365
00:19:25,060 --> 00:19:28,020
Thanks for coming.

366
00:19:42,690 --> 00:19:45,190
I forgot to feed them.

367
00:19:45,190 --> 00:19:46,810
Even though I was supposed to.

368
00:19:46,810 --> 00:19:50,520
By end of summer break, they were all dead.

369
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:54,440
I was the one who told
everyone it was your fault.

370
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:56,480
It was me!

371
00:19:58,520 --> 00:20:00,440
Okay.

372
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:06,150
Miyamura, you know, I'm...

373
00:20:06,150 --> 00:20:08,230
I'm...

374
00:20:11,770 --> 00:20:13,980
I'm sorry.

375
00:20:13,980 --> 00:20:17,940
What if I'd been able to tell him back then?

376
00:20:17,940 --> 00:20:20,850
It hurts my heart to think about it.

377
00:20:22,770 --> 00:20:24,850
Okay, last one.

378
00:20:24,850 --> 00:20:27,190
Thanks for helping out.

379
00:20:29,770 --> 00:20:32,230
Yearbooks!

380
00:20:32,230 --> 00:20:35,850
Oh, that's from middle school.

381
00:20:35,850 --> 00:20:38,560
What'd she look like back then?

382
00:20:38,560 --> 00:20:41,440
Peek and you're a dead man.

383
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:43,600
They're so annoying.

384
00:20:43,600 --> 00:20:48,940
They're big, and in the way, but you don't
actually wanna throw them away...

385
00:20:48,940 --> 00:20:55,440
